  "interpretation": "<ul data-start=\"1135\" data-end=\"1457\">\n<li data-start=\"1135\" data-end=\"1274\">\n<p data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1274\">The <strong data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1153\">GBA gene</strong> encodes <strong data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1186\">&beta;-glucocerebrosidase</strong>, and mutations in this gene are associated with <strong data-start=\"1235\" data-end=\"1254\">Gaucher Disease</strong> (Types I, II, III).</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1275\" data-end=\"1365\">\n<p data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1365\">The identified variant(s) is/are consistent with <strong data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1364\">[Type of Gaucher Disease if known]</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1366\" data-end=\"1457\">\n<p data-start=\"1368\" data-end=\"1457\"><strong data-start=\"1368\" data-end=\"1380\">Zygosity</strong> of the mutation is important for assessing disease severity and inheritance.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
